  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TA to make Start-up financing possible. The jewelry market is worldwide dominated by 10 key players, who don&apos;t offer much innovation. Rafu Appu has a fresh approach to this extremely traditional jewellery market. They innovate with sourcing, selection, processing, production, finish, pricing and marketing. Currently 90% of gemstones in mines is considered waste because it&#x2019;s not perfectly transparent has some spots, colour is a bit &#x2018;off&#x2019;, etc. Rafu Appu buys all of these stones directly from the mines and has a team of goldsmiths, etc. to make jewellery that is truly unique: each stone is different because &#x2018;imperfect&#x2019;, different sports, vagueness, etc.</narrative>
  </description>
